{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"这段最值得解释的不是“感受更强了”，而是它在刚经历过断续、反复聚集之后，又重新进入较连续、较清楚的表达，却没有因此变成稳定的持续状态；表达内部仍一阵阵加重、收回，像把刚才未能维持的连续性重新接起来，但接起来以后仍有波动。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"H2：较清楚地表达过之后，这份感受并没有稳定下来；连续表达维持不住时，会转成断续、反复重新聚集。\",\"bridge\":\"既然刚才的连续表达曾经散开并需要反复重新聚集，那么再次回到连续、清楚的表达时，前一段留下的不是一个已经解决的问题，而是一种“能够重新连起来、但还不能稳稳维持”的状态。\",\"current\":\"因此现在即使重新出现连续的表达形态，感受也不是平直地保持在同一强度，而会在较明确的陈述中反复出现加重和退回；这是重新获得连续性之后仍未稳定的表现，不需要假定发生了新的外部回应或关系变化。\",\"without\":\"如果没有H2，当前只能看成一次本身带有强弱起伏的清楚表达；有了H2，才更具体地成为“刚从断续重新聚拢后恢复连续，但恢复并不等于稳定”。\"},\"used\":[\"H2\"],\"new_history\":[\"在经历连续表达散开、反复重新聚集之后，他能够再次进入较清楚的连续表达，但这种恢复并不会立刻消除内部的强弱波动。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"因果依赖H2所建立的“连续表达曾维持不住并转为反复聚集”，而不是仅用主题回归或力度增强推断心理变化；没有把当前回归解释成对方回应、关系恢复或问题解决。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5ee2fc87-0b90-4f15-b79b-52112feb18ad", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214323343715Z", "elapsed_seconds": 18.578, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:43:41.922424+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9b3592d8295d91613a71d76d31a2720abbfc19434b86e9cfbe8662aae148e3b7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214323343715Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b2c7789f01b70af1c48a0f08ed18522fbce56bc64d119b597b00fa43c667169a"}}}
